OL,3,GNEWSABurst main sparks flood as homes
OL,4,Aleft with no water
OL,5,
OL,6,FA burst water main on the edge of
OL,7,FBristol has caused flooding, with
OL,8,Fhundreds of residents experiencing low
OL,9,Fwater pressure or no supply.
OL,11,FBristol Water has said properties in
OL,12,Fthe BS34, BS32, BS7 and BS10 postcodes
OL,13,Fare affected by the burst main between
OL,14,FHammond Road and Hayes Way in Patchway.
OL,16,FA spokesperson for the firm said it was
OL,17,F"working as quickly as possible" to
OL,18,Frepair the "significant burst", which
OL,19,Fwas reported at 04:30 BST.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
