OL,3,GNEWSABurst main sparks flood as homes
OL,4,Aleft with no water
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt initially impacted 8,813 customers,
OL,7,Fbut the spokesperson said that had
OL,8,Freduced to 1,442 and added the firm was
OL,9,Flooking to deliver bottled water to its
OL,10,Fmost vulnerable customers.
